- op: discuss  # aa6a
  at: '2026-07-19T21:26:06Z'  # aa6a
  by: agent  # aa6a
  actor: jgstern_agent  # aa6a
  clock: 10  # aa6a
  nonce: aa6a  # aa6a
  message: "SATISFIED on the CORRECTED acceptance property (owner-approved path C, 2026-07-19; INV-nuzas/INV-vavat precedent of resolving an INV whose filed premise was refuted). Original premise — 'framework_dispatch should hold a bare framework NAME; it mixes framework names with mechanism names, two axes in one field' — was REFUTED by a four-lens review (ADR / spec / history / spirit, all → keep+document). Findings: (1) framework_dispatch IS one coherent axis by design — ADR-0028 Cluster 28C is literally the 'framework-dispatch CONVENTION' fold; its values are dispatch-convention identifiers (framework-specific compounds django_orm/kafka_streams/tauri_invoke AND framework-agnostic mechanisms registry_dispatch/npm_package), the deliberate fold residues, NOT an axis leak to split. (2) The 'bare framework name' reading is a literal over-reading of audit-0014's '<framework_name>' shorthand, contradicted by that audit's own compound examples, ADR-0028:80 (treats django_orm as one meta-bound unit), and spec §9 line 903 ('Framework-dispatch convention name'). (3) detection_pattern is a SEPARATE coherent axis (pattern-shape match heuristics: abi_name_match/jni_naming) — moving convention values there (options A/B) would contradict audit-0014's own verdict table, which deliberately placed registry_dispatch/npm_package in framework_dispatch. (4) The '>=30 values / >=30 producers' threshold cited in the item + audit-0014 is FABRICATED — ADR-0024 rule 3's real threshold is '>=3 values OR >=2 producers'; the key trips it ~15x, but rule-3 promotion (key->typed Edge.framework) is an ordered gate behind rules 1-2 which framework_dispatch survives neither, so ADR-0028 OQ2 stays DECLINED (2026-07-05). (5) ZERO production consumers read the key (grep-verified) — pure provenance. EVIDENCE (docs-only PR #753, CI-green, merged): axis_meta_keys.py MetaKeySpec descriptions rewritten to name the coherent axis + value space + re-eval trigger; audit-findings 0014 threshold corrected (both sites) + dated Correction clarifying the dispatch-convention-vs-pattern-shape discriminator; spec §9 updated. Live value enumeration: 45 distinct values / ~30 producers, all dispatch conventions. The one residual homogeneity nit (framework-agnostic sentinels beside framework-specific compounds) is zero-consumer, zero-urgency, documented in-place; a typed Edge.framework escalation remains available if a consumer ever materializes."  # aa6a
